			"notes": "## HBM Nuclear Tech 1.20.1 — Alpha 1.0.33\n\nUnofficial Forge **1.20.1** port. Expect bugs and missing content.\n\nThis is a **survival factory** alpha: ores, processing machines, and tools are playable. It is not a complete 1.7.10 port.\n\n### Highlights\n- Worldgen ores and early metal progression\n- Anvil, press, shredder, centrifuge, assembly machine, chemical plant\n- Oil well / pumpjack, refinery and related fluid processing\n- Power (cables, batteries, diesel / combustion, RTG)\n- NTM tools with 1.7-style mining speed, damage, and abilities (vein mine, hammer, silk, fortune)\n- Matchsticks, hand drills, wood gavel, bottle opener\n- Existing nuke, radiation, missile, and radar content from 1.0.32\n\n### Still missing\n- Guns and most turrets\n- RBMK simulation\n- Bulk catalog stubs (tooltips mark Working / WIP / Not implemented)\n\n### Requirements\n- Minecraft 1.20.1\n- Forge 47.x (built against 47.4.10)\n- Java 17\n\n### Meta\n- Issue tracker: https://github.com/Masala37/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-1.20.1/issues\n- Project page: https://masala37.github.io/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-1.20.1/\n\nNot affiliated with the original Hbm 1.7.10 releases."
