			"notes": "## HBM Nuclear Tech 1.20.1 — Alpha 1.0.32\n\nUnofficial Forge **1.20.1** port. Expect bugs and missing content.\n\n**_THIS VERSION IS BUGFIX_**\n\n### Highlights\n- Infinite fluid barrel now fills pads, launchers, diesel gens, and steel barrels\n- Empty silo/large-pad tanks use the loaded missile's fuel (ethanol / kerosene / jet fuel + peroxide or loxy)\n- Empty diesel generator fills diesel (1.7 default tank type)\n- Right-click no longer no-ops because Forge bucket transfer cannot drain a typeless source\n\n### Requirements\n- Minecraft 1.20.1\n- Forge 47.x (built against 47.4.10)\n- Java 17\n\n### Meta\n- Issue tracker: https://github.com/Masala37/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-1.20.1/issues\n- Project page: https://masala37.github.io/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-1.20.1/\n\nNot affiliated with the original Hbm 1.7.10 releases."
