			"notes": "## HBM Nuclear Tech 1.20.1 — Alpha 1.0.31\n\nUnofficial Forge **1.20.1** port. Expect bugs and missing content.\n\n### Highlights\n- Compact launcher, launch table, large silo, and rusted doomsday pad\n- Custom missile parts + assembly (SIZE_10/15 on pads, SIZE_20 on the launch table)\n- Radar NT, large radar, radar screen, and linker\n- Manual coordinate designator\n- Tier-4 / specialty warheads: nuclear, MIRV, volcano, doomsday, drill, inferno, rain, shuttle, ABM\n- Full 1.7 sound catalog (pad takeoff, diesel loop, crate open/close)\n- Pad fuel types match 1.7 (ethanol / kerosene / jet fuel + peroxide or loxy by missile)\n\n### Requirements\n- Minecraft 1.20.1\n- Forge 47.x (built against 47.4.10)\n- Java 17\n\n### Status (see README)\n- Bombs / nukes / detonators — mostly done\n- Radiation, Sellafield, hazmat — WIP\n- Bomb caller / missiles — alpha (pads, custom assembly, radar, T0–T4 + ABM)\n- Early machines — partial (furnace, battery, diesel, combustion, crates, cables)\n- RBMK, weapons, most machines — missing or stub\n\nIn-game tooltips and creative tabs still mark Working / WIP / Not implemented.\n\n### Meta\n- Issue tracker: https://github.com/Masala37/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-1.20.1/issues\n- Project page: https://masala37.github.io/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-1.20.1/\n\nNot affiliated with the original Hbm 1.7.10 releases."
		},
